{"key":"ics/T0893","id":"T0893","name":"Data from Local System","domain":"ics","level":"technique","parent_id":null,"tactics":["collection"],"platforms":["None"],"environments":["ics-ot"],"environment_basis":"project_taxonomy_from_upstream_platforms","summary":"Adversaries may target and collect data from local system sources, such as file systems, configuration files, or local databases. This can include sensitive data such as specifications, schematics, or diagrams of control system layouts, devices, and processes. Adversaries may do this using Command-Line Interface or Scripting techniques to interact with the file system to gather information. Adversaries may also use Automated Collection on the…","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T0893","source_stix_id":"attack-pattern--fa3aa267-da22-4bdd-961f-03223322a8d5","source_modified":"2025-04-15T19:59:23.577Z","source_object_version":"1.0","telemetry":{"status":"mapped","components":[{"id":"DC0064","name":"Command Execution","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0064","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--685f917a-e95e-4ba0-ade1-c7d354dae6e0","page":"telemetry/DC0064/"},{"id":"DC0055","name":"File Access","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0055","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--235b7491-2d2b-4617-9a52-3c0783680f71","page":"telemetry/DC0055/"},{"id":"DC0021","name":"OS API Execution","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0021","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--9bde2f9d-a695-4344-bfac-f2dce13d121e","page":"telemetry/DC0021/"},{"id":"DC0032","name":"Process Creation","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0032","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--3d20385b-24ef-40e1-9f56-f39750379077","page":"telemetry/DC0032/"},{"id":"DC0029","name":"Script Execution","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0029","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--9f387817-df83-432a-b56b-a8fb7f71eedd","page":"telemetry/DC0029/"}],"strategies":[{"id":"DET0749","name":"Detection of Data fr